@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@plantaId = 1
@username = admin
@password = admin

### Criar ou reutilizar sessão
POST {{baseUrl}}/plantas/{{plantaId}}/doctor/session
Authorization: Basic {{$base64 {{username}}:{{password}}}}

### Reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/plantas/{{plantaId}}/doctor/session/reset
Authorization: Basic {{$base64 {{username}}:{{password}}}}

### P01 - o que é tripes?
POST {{baseUrl}}/plantas/{{plantaId}}/doctor/session/messages
Authorization: Basic {{$base64 {{username}}:{{password}}}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mensagem": "o que é tripes?",
  "modo": "AUTO"
}

### P02 - quais são os sinais de tripes na planta?
